@application = http://localhost:8083
@candidates = http://localhost:8082
@applicationId = 1

### Read application with candidate profile (replace applicationId from SQL)
GET {{application}}/api/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}
X-User-ID: 42
X-User-Email: demo@example.com
X-User-Name: Demo User

### Reset before an independent scenario
POST {{application}}/api/v1/circuit-breakers/candidateDetails/resets

### Normal candidate-service
PUT {{candidates}}/api/v1/services/candidate-service/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"NORMAL","delayMs":0}

### Simulate 503; read application 5 times then a sixth time
PUT {{candidates}}/api/v1/services/candidate-service/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"ERROR","delayMs":0}

### Slow success (read timeout 5000ms)
PUT {{candidates}}/api/v1/services/candidate-service/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"SLOW","delayMs":3000}

### Ignored business error
PUT {{candidates}}/api/v1/services/candidate-service/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"NOT_FOUND","delayMs":0}

### Read timeout
PUT {{candidates}}/api/v1/services/candidate-service/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"SLOW","delayMs":7000}

### State and counters
GET {{application}}/api/v1/circuit-breakers/candidateDetails

### Received downstream calls (does not increase while circuit blocks)
GET {{candidates}}/api/v1/services/candidate-service/behavior

### Recent events
GET {{application}}/actuator/circuitbreakerevents/candidateDetails

### Health
GET {{application}}/actuator/health

### Metrics
GET {{application}}/actuator/metrics/resilience4j.circuitbreaker.calls?tag=name:candidateDetails

### Prometheus scrape
GET {{application}}/actuator/prometheus
